# Nearby Shops — Mega-Upgrade Implementation Plan v2

> Complete shop ecosystem: Registration → Category-specific Dashboard → Visitor Discovery → Buy/Book → Delivery → Commission → Super Admin Control

**Scope:** Website only. Mobile app will be upgraded separately after website completion.

---

## Decisions Confirmed (from your feedback)

| Decision | Your Choice |
|---|---|
| Commission Model | **Hybrid** — Percentage + Flat Convenience Fee, configurable per category by Super Admin |
| Geolocation | **Browser API** + **IP-based fallback** if user denies permission |
| Shop Registration | Must capture **exact GPS location** (map picker) |
| Service Catalog | **Yes** — with pricing, duration. Free services available for paid/premium shop owners |
| Staff Availability | **Yes** — configurable working hours & off-days per staff, managed by Shop Owner |
| Hybrid Shop Type | **Dedicated hybrid flow** (not just "both") |
| Delivery | **Integrated** with existing `delivery_agents` — user chooses Pickup or Delivery |
| Value-Add Features | **All 6 included** — Notifications, Staff Performance, Surge Pricing, Badges, QR, Re-book |
| Super Admin Control | **Complete modification access** over ALL revenue models, commissions, categories |
| Service Freebies | Super Admin can mark certain services as **free for Premium shops** |

