**Delivery Fee Calculation:**
```js
const baseFee = adminConfig.delivery_base_fee || 40;
const perKmRate = adminConfig.delivery_per_km_rate || 8;
const distanceKm = haversineDistance(shopLat, shopLng, customerLat, customerLng);
const deliveryFee = baseFee + (perKmRate * distanceKm);
// Super Admin can override these rates
```

