#### 7. 🧾 Auto Invoice & Digital Receipt
Every order/appointment generates a professional PDF invoice with: Invoice number, Shop details, Line items, GST (if applicable), Commission breakdown (hidden from customer). Customer receives invoice via email/WhatsApp. Shop owner can download all invoices.

