Auto-send reminders to customers: 24 hours before + 1 hour before an appointment. Via in-app notification + WhatsApp. Reduces no-shows.

#### 10. 🔄 Return & Refund Management
For product orders: customer can request a return/refund within X hours (Super Admin configurable). Shop owner reviews → approves/rejects. Refund to wallet or original payment method. Commission is reversed on refund.

#### 11. 📊 Customer CRM for Shop Owners
In the shop dashboard, show a "My Customers" tab: List of all customers who've ordered/booked, with: Total orders, Total spend, Last visit date, Preferred products/services. Helps shop owners build relationships.

#### 12. 🗺️ Map View for Nearby Shops
Add a "Map View" toggle on the `/shops` page (alongside the grid view). Shows all shops as pins on an interactive map. Click pin → shop card popup. User's location shown as a blue dot.

#### 13. 🕐 Estimated Delivery Time Calculator
