#### 14. 📦 Order Scheduling (Future Delivery)
Allow customers to schedule orders for a future date/time. "Deliver tomorrow at 10 AM" or "Schedule for next Saturday". Shop owner sees scheduled orders in a separate queue.

#### 15. 🏢 Multi-Branch Support
Some shops (e.g., chain bakeries, salons) have multiple branches. Allow a single shop owner to manage multiple branches from one dashboard. Each branch has its own location, staff, and inventory.

#### 16. 💳 Shop Owner Payout Dashboard
