Shop owners can post announcements visible on their shop page: "Closed on July 4th", "New menu items added!", "Special Diwali offer". Shown as a scrollable banner.

#### 19. 🧪 A/B Testing for Promotions (Super Admin)
Super Admin can A/B test different commission rates, convenience fees, or promotional placements for a subset of shops. Track which configuration drives more orders.

